SUPPORTS
1 FIXED
CUT OFF MODE SHAPE 6
* Masses: self-weight (density x area) converted to mass in X and Y. STAAD lumps masses at the joints;
* compare with Frame2D's lumped-mass option. Frequencies appear under CALCULATED FREQUENCIES.
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE None TITLE MASSES
SELFWEIGHT X 1
SELFWEIGHT Y 1
MODAL CALCULATION REQUESTED
PERFORM ANALYSIS
PRINT JOINT DISPLACEMENTS ALL
FINISH
